Audio Duration: 2m 4.8s (124.79s)
Start Time (Malaysia): 2026-11-10 07:54:34 +08
Detected Language: zh (Prob: 1.00)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,500] | Elapsed:  15.73s | Words: 7  | Text: 不是赢了才叫厉害
Segment #2   [00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:03,460] | Elapsed:  15.73s | Words: 10 | Text: 能主动退出消耗自己的局
Segment #3   [00:00:03,460 --> 00:00:05,180] | Elapsed:  15.73s | Words: 7  | Text: 才是真正的强大
Segment #4   [00:00:05,180 --> 00:00:06,040] | Elapsed:  15.73s | Words: 4  | Text: 很多人以为
Segment #5   [00:00:06,040 --> 00:00:08,780] | Elapsed:  15.73s | Words: 14 | Text: 厉害的人就是那种冯山开路玉水大桥
Segment #6   [00:00:08,780 --> 00:00:09,960] | Elapsed:  15.73s | Words: 6  | Text: 什么局都能赢的人
Segment #7   [00:00:09,960 --> 00:00:10,620] | Elapsed:  15.73s | Words: 2  | Text: 错了
Segment #8   [00:00:10,620 --> 00:00:12,360] | Elapsed:  15.73s | Words: 10 | Text: 真正厉害的人不是赢的局多
Segment #9   [00:00:12,360 --> 00:00:13,800] | Elapsed:  15.73s | Words: 8  | Text: 是他知道哪个局该退
Segment #10  [00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:15,560] | Elapsed:  15.73s | Words: 9  | Text: 谁影响我 我就放弃谁
Segment #11  [00:00:15,560 --> 00:00:17,040] | Elapsed:  15.73s | Words: 9  | Text: 谁贬低我 我就离开谁
Segment #12  [00:00:17,040 --> 00:00:18,620] | Elapsed:  15.73s | Words: 8  | Text: 但凡能做到这点的人
Segment #13  [00:00:18,620 --> 00:00:21,260] | Elapsed:  15.73s | Words: 14 | Text: 人生里99%的烦恼全都赢人而解
Segment #14  [00:00:21,260 --> 00:00:22,560] | Elapsed:  15.73s | Words: 5  | Text: 为什么退出这么难
Segment #15  [00:00:22,560 --> 00:00:23,440] | Elapsed:  15.73s | Words: 4  | Text: 因为不甘心
Segment #16  [00:00:23,920 --> 00:00:25,980] | Elapsed:  15.73s | Words: 12 | Text: 你在一段关系里耗了三年五年
Segment #17  [00:00:25,980 --> 00:00:27,100] | Elapsed:  15.73s | Words: 6  | Text: 你说放下就放下
Segment #18  [00:00:27,100 --> 00:00:28,900] | Elapsed:  15.73s | Words: 9  | Text: 你在一个圈子里混了那么久
Segment #19  [00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:30,040] | Elapsed:  35.96s | Words: 6  | Text: 你说退出就退出
Segment #20  [00:00:30,040 --> 00:00:32,120] | Elapsed:  35.96s | Words: 10 | Text: 你总觉得我都投入这么多了
Segment #21  [00:00:32,120 --> 00:00:33,600] | Elapsed:  35.96s | Words: 9  | Text: 现在走了不就全白费了吗
Segment #22  [00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:35,600] | Elapsed:  35.96s | Words: 10 | Text: 但你有没有想过你继续耗下去
Segment #23  [00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:36,920] | Elapsed:  35.96s | Words: 8  | Text: 浪费的不是三年五年
Segment #24  [00:00:36,920 --> 00:00:37,980] | Elapsed:  35.96s | Words: 5  | Text: 是剩下一辈子
Segment #25  [00:00:37,980 --> 00:00:39,560] | Elapsed:  35.96s | Words: 6  | Text: 那个一直消耗你的人
Segment #26  [00:00:39,560 --> 00:00:40,260] | Elapsed:  35.96s | Words: 4  | Text: 他会变吗
Segment #27  [00:00:40,260 --> 00:00:40,560] | Elapsed:  35.96s | Words: 1  | Text: 不会
Segment #28  [00:00:40,560 --> 00:00:41,860] | Elapsed:  35.96s | Words: 7  | Text: 那个一直贬低你的环境
Segment #29  [00:00:41,860 --> 00:00:42,460] | Elapsed:  35.96s | Words: 4  | Text: 他会好吗
Segment #30  [00:00:42,460 --> 00:00:42,800] | Elapsed:  35.96s | Words: 2  | Text: 也不会
Segment #31  [00:00:42,800 --> 00:00:43,960] | Elapsed:  35.96s | Words: 8  | Text: 你抱着那点不甘心
Segment #32  [00:00:43,960 --> 00:00:45,100] | Elapsed:  35.96s | Words: 7  | Text: 在一个烂局里死磕
Segment #33  [00:00:45,100 --> 00:00:46,500] | Elapsed:  35.96s | Words: 7  | Text: 最后磕死的不是局
Segment #34  [00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:47,260] | Elapsed:  35.96s | Words: 3  | Text: 是你自己
Segment #35  [00:00:47,660 --> 00:00:49,460] | Elapsed:  35.96s | Words: 10 | Text: 我们没有办法选择跟谁相遇
Segment #36  [00:00:49,460 --> 00:00:50,460] | Elapsed:  35.96s | Words: 5  | Text: 但是我们可以选择
Segment #37  [00:00:50,460 --> 00:00:51,080] | Elapsed:  35.96s | Words: 4  | Text: 跟谁同情
Segment #38  [00:00:51,080 --> 00:00:52,800] | Elapsed:  35.96s | Words: 8  | Text: 你身边的人就是你的磁场
Segment #39  [00:00:52,800 --> 00:00:54,400] | Elapsed:  35.96s | Words: 8  | Text: 天天跟抱怨的人在一起
Segment #40  [00:00:54,400 --> 00:00:55,460] | Elapsed:  35.96s | Words: 6  | Text: 你就会变得消极
Segment #41  [00:00:55,460 --> 00:00:56,820] | Elapsed:  35.96s | Words: 8  | Text: 天天跟算计的人在一起
Segment #42  [00:00:56,820 --> 00:00:57,820] | Elapsed:  56.10s | Words: 6  | Text: 你就会变得多疑
Segment #43  [00:00:57,820 --> 00:00:59,580] | Elapsed:  56.10s | Words: 9  | Text: 天天跟消耗你的人在一起
Segment #44  [00:00:59,580 --> 00:01:00,720] | Elapsed:  56.10s | Words: 8  | Text: 你就会变得越来越差
Segment #45  [00:01:00,720 --> 00:01:01,860] | Elapsed:  56.10s | Words: 6  | Text: 你以为你在坚持
Segment #46  [00:01:01,860 --> 00:01:03,060] | Elapsed:  56.10s | Words: 6  | Text: 你是在被慢慢拖垮
Segment #47  [00:01:03,060 --> 00:01:03,880] | Elapsed:  56.10s | Words: 3  | Text: 还有一点
Segment #48  [00:01:03,880 --> 00:01:05,400] | Elapsed:  56.10s | Words: 10 | Text: 不要把解释当作一种习惯
Segment #49  [00:01:05,400 --> 00:01:06,240] | Elapsed:  56.10s | Words: 3  | Text: 懂你的人
Segment #50  [00:01:06,240 --> 00:01:07,580] | Elapsed:  56.10s | Words: 8  | Text: 他不需要你掏心掏肺
Segment #51  [00:01:07,580 --> 00:01:08,680] | Elapsed:  56.10s | Words: 4  | Text: 不懂你的人
Segment #52  [00:01:08,680 --> 00:01:10,760] | Elapsed:  56.10s | Words: 13 | Text: 就算你把心肝匹肺肾全都挖出来
Segment #53  [00:01:10,760 --> 00:01:12,060] | Elapsed:  56.10s | Words: 7  | Text: 人家也觉得你在演戏
Segment #54  [00:01:12,460 --> 00:01:13,540] | Elapsed:  56.10s | Words: 6  | Text: 你有没有这种经历
Segment #55  [00:01:13,540 --> 00:01:14,520] | Elapsed:  56.10s | Words: 6  | Text: 你被人误会了
Segment #56  [00:01:14,520 --> 00:01:15,560] | Elapsed:  56.10s | Words: 7  | Text: 你急着跟他解释
Segment #57  [00:01:15,560 --> 00:01:16,300] | Elapsed:  56.10s | Words: 5  | Text: 解释了半天
Segment #58  [00:01:16,300 --> 00:01:16,980] | Elapsed:  56.10s | Words: 4  | Text: 他还是不信
Segment #59  [00:01:16,980 --> 00:01:17,940] | Elapsed:  56.10s | Words: 4  | Text: 你越解释
Segment #60  [00:01:17,940 --> 00:01:19,060] | Elapsed:  56.10s | Words: 6  | Text: 他越觉得你心虚
Segment #61  [00:01:19,060 --> 00:01:20,320] | Elapsed:  56.10s | Words: 6  | Text: 你越想证明自己
Segment #62  [00:01:20,320 --> 00:01:21,540] | Elapsed:  56.10s | Words: 5  | Text: 他越觉得你有问题
Segment #63  [00:01:21,940 --> 00:01:22,260] | Elapsed:  56.10s | Words: 1  | Text: 为什么
Segment #64  [00:01:22,260 --> 00:01:24,000] | Elapsed:  56.10s | Words: 11 | Text: 因为他心里已经给你定了性了
Segment #65  [00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:24,900] | Elapsed:  75.90s | Words: 5  | Text: 你说什么都没用
Segment #66  [00:01:24,900 --> 00:01:27,300] | Elapsed:  75.90s | Words: 12 | Text: 成年人的世界里最省事的做法
Segment #67  [00:01:27,300 --> 00:01:28,380] | Elapsed:  75.90s | Words: 4  | Text: 就是不解释
Segment #68  [00:01:28,380 --> 00:01:29,560] | Elapsed:  75.90s | Words: 6  | Text: 懂你的人自然懂
Segment #69  [00:01:29,560 --> 00:01:30,920] | Elapsed:  75.90s | Words: 8  | Text: 不懂的人解释也没用
Segment #70  [00:01:30,920 --> 00:01:32,780] | Elapsed:  75.90s | Words: 9  | Text: 你把解释的时间省下来
Segment #71  [00:01:32,780 --> 00:01:34,520] | Elapsed:  75.90s | Words: 10 | Text: 用来过好自己的日子不好吗
Segment #72  [00:01:34,520 --> 00:01:36,200] | Elapsed:  75.90s | Words: 10 | Text: 成年人心照不宣的默契
Segment #73  [00:01:36,200 --> 00:01:37,200] | Elapsed:  75.90s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是猫有猫到
Segment #74  [00:01:37,200 --> 00:01:38,020] | Elapsed:  75.90s | Words: 4  | Text: 鼠有鼠到
Segment #75  [00:01:38,020 --> 00:01:38,700] | Elapsed:  75.90s | Words: 3  | Text: 管好自己
Segment #76  [00:01:38,700 --> 00:01:39,800] | Elapsed:  75.90s | Words: 5  | Text: 少操心别人
Segment #77  [00:01:39,800 --> 00:01:40,820] | Elapsed:  75.90s | Words: 6  | Text: 你过好你的日子
Segment #78  [00:01:40,820 --> 00:01:41,840] | Elapsed:  75.90s | Words: 6  | Text: 他过好他的日子
Segment #79  [00:01:41,840 --> 00:01:42,780] | Elapsed:  75.90s | Words: 6  | Text: 谁也别评判谁
Segment #80  [00:01:42,780 --> 00:01:43,680] | Elapsed:  75.90s | Words: 6  | Text: 谁也别消耗谁
Segment #81  [00:01:43,680 --> 00:01:45,480] | Elapsed:  75.90s | Words: 9  | Text: 这个世界上最顶级的活法
Segment #82  [00:01:45,480 --> 00:01:46,640] | Elapsed:  75.90s | Words: 4  | Text: 就是不纠缠
Segment #83  [00:01:46,640 --> 00:01:47,200] | Elapsed:  75.90s | Words: 3  | Text: 不解释
Segment #84  [00:01:47,200 --> 00:01:47,780] | Elapsed:  75.90s | Words: 3  | Text: 不讨好
Segment #85  [00:01:47,780 --> 00:01:48,660] | Elapsed:  75.90s | Words: 6  | Text: 谁让你不舒服
Segment #86  [00:01:48,660 --> 00:01:49,380] | Elapsed:  75.90s | Words: 4  | Text: 你就离开谁
Segment #87  [00:01:49,380 --> 00:01:50,020] | Elapsed:  75.90s | Words: 4  | Text: 谁消耗你
Segment #88  [00:01:50,020 --> 00:01:50,700] | Elapsed:  75.90s | Words: 4  | Text: 你就放弃谁
Segment #89  [00:01:50,700 --> 00:01:51,840] | Elapsed:  75.90s | Words: 4  | Text: 不要觉得可惜
Segment #90  [00:01:51,840 --> 00:01:52,780] | Elapsed:  87.14s | Words: 5  | Text: 不要觉得舍不得
Segment #91  [00:01:52,780 --> 00:01:54,180] | Elapsed:  87.14s | Words: 7  | Text: 你舍不得的那个人
Segment #92  [00:01:54,180 --> 00:01:54,800] | Elapsed:  87.14s | Words: 2  | Text: 那个局
Segment #93  [00:01:54,800 --> 00:01:55,940] | Elapsed:  87.14s | Words: 5  | Text: 他消耗你的时候
Segment #94  [00:01:55,940 --> 00:01:56,860] | Elapsed:  87.14s | Words: 6  | Text: 可没有舍不得你
Segment #95  [00:01:56,860 --> 00:01:57,840] | Elapsed:  87.14s | Words: 5  | Text: 记住一句话
Segment #96  [00:01:57,840 --> 00:01:59,560] | Elapsed:  87.14s | Words: 10 | Text: 赢了所有对手都不算厉害
Segment #97  [00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:01,200] | Elapsed:  87.14s | Words: 9  | Text: 能及时从烂局里抽身
Segment #98  [00:02:01,200 --> 00:02:02,540] | Elapsed:  87.14s | Words: 7  | Text: 才是真正的强大
Segment #99  [00:02:02,540 --> 00:02:03,720] | Elapsed:  87.14s | Words: 4  | Text: 加油陌生人
Segment #100 [00:02:03,720 --> 00:02:04,680] | Elapsed:  87.14s | Words: 6  | Text: 祝你越来越好
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
